*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*  Globale Merker NC <-> PLC
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*  Legende:
*
*    X_      = Achse X
*    Y_      = Achse Y
*    Z_      = Achse Z
*    4_      = Achse 4
*    5_      = Achse 5
*    S_      = Spindel
*    Spg     = Spannung
*    Posit   = Positionierung
*    BA      = Betriebsart
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

